{"id":"00401","root":"uni00401_1","name":{"ja":"大人ゆきかぜ","en":"Adult Yukikaze"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"大人ゆきかぜ","en":"Adult Yukikaze"},"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-11-25","limited":true,"characterId":247,"profile":{"ja":"次元侵略者・ブレインフレーヤーによって別次元世界から連れて来られた未来のゆきかぜ。未来のゆきかぜは完全に雷遁の術を制御できており、それどころか凜子の“逸刀流”や雷遁の術を応用した幻影術まで操ることが出来るという。人呼んで“雷神の対魔忍”。未来のゆきかぜには、雷遁の力を制御する得物“ライトニングシューター”が必要なくなり、代わりに最大限の力を使った時に肉体の負荷を軽減するための『雷撃の断罪者（ライトニングパニッシャー）』という対魔忍スーツと一体化した特殊武装を装備している。ゆきかぜは指先から糸のような雷を出して操る“雷蜘蛛（ライトニングウェブ）”、同様に指先から針のような電気を放つ“雷苦無（ライトニングボルト）”、両手から雷の剣を出現させて戦う“雷剣（ライトニングソード）”、自分を中心にした周囲を雷撃で爆破する“雷爆（ライトニングボム）”など多彩な技を操る。","en":"She was brought from another dimension by the dimensional invader, Brain Flayer. The future Yukikaze has complete control over the Raijin technique and can even manipulate Rinko's \"Isshiki-ryu\" and the illusion technique derived from Raijin. She is known as the \"Taimanin of the Thunder God.\" The future Yukikaze no longer needs the Lightning Shooter to control her Raijin powers, and instead, she is equipped with the \"Lightning Punisher,\" a special Taimanin suit that reduces the physical strain when using her maximum power. Yukikaze can manipulate various techniques, such as \"Lightning Web,\" \"Lightning Bolt,\" \"Lightning Sword,\" and \"Lightning Bomb.\""},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"氷室百合","forms":[{"id":"uni00401_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1334,2668],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[212,424],"def":[153,306],"spd":[76,76],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","860001"]},{"id":"uni00401_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1868,3736],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[324,648],"def":[206,412],"spd":[76,76],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","860001","860002"]},{"id":"uni00401_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2402,4801],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[436,871],"def":[259,521],"spd":[76,76],"luck":[1,100]},"sp