象が少ないほど威力がアップ）"}},{"level":5,"sp":300,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に中威力で攻撃する（残りHPが低い敵ほど威力がアップ、さらに攻撃対象が少ないほど威力がアップ）"}}],"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 800% Natural damage, stronger the lower the target's remaining HP"},{"text":"Power rises the fewer targets there are"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"雷神の対魔忍"},"detail":{"ja":"部隊全体のATKを中アップ+会心率を中アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"All allies: ATK +15%","icon":"atk_up"},{"text":"All allies: crit rate +5","icon":"crt_up"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":1,"gold":2,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00003",40],[1,"ubl00401",50],[2,"blo00007",10],[2,"blo00008",10],[3,"blo00010",10],[3,"blo00011",10],[4,"blo00013",10],[4,"blo00014",10],[5,"blo00007",10],[5,"blo00008",10],[6,"blo00010",10],[6,"blo00011",10],[7,"blo00013",10],[7,"blo00014",10],[8,"blo00007",10],[8,"blo00008",10],[9,"blo00010",5],[9,"blo00011",15],[9,"blo00012",5],[10,"blo00007",5],[10,"blo00008",15],[10,"blo00009",5],[11,"blo00013",5],[11,"blo00014",15],[11,"blo00015",5],[12,"blo00003",80],[12,"ubl00401",100],[13,"blo00007",5],[13,"blo00008",15],[13,"blo00009",5],[14,"blo00010",5],[14,"blo00011",15],[14,"blo00012",5],[15,"blo00013",5],[15,"blo00014",15],[15,"blo00015",5],[16,"blo00007",5],[16,"blo00008",15],[16,"blo00009",5],[17,"blo00010",5],[17,"blo00011",15],[17,"blo00012",5],[18,"blo00013",5],[18,"blo00014",15],[18,"blo00015",5],[19,"blo00007",5],[19,"blo00008",15],[19,"blo00009",5],[20,"blo00011",10],[20,"blo00012",15],[21,"blo00008",10],[21,"blo00009",15],[22,"blo00014",10],[22,"blo00015",15],[23,"blo00011",10],[23,"blo00012",15],[24,"blo00008",10],[24,"blo00009",15],[25,"blo00014",10],[25,"blo00015",15],[26,"blo00003",30],[26,"ubl00401",50],[27,"blo00009",5],[27,"blo00012",5],[27,"blo00015",5],[28,"blo00009",5],[28,"blo00012",5],[28,"blo00015",5],[29,"blo00009",5],[29,"blo00012",5],[29,"blo00015",5],[30,"blo00009",5],[30,"blo00012",5],[30,"blo00015",5],[31,"blo00003",25],[31,"ubl00401",100],[32,"blo00009",5],[32,"blo00012",5],[32,"blo00015",5],[33,"blo00009",5],[33,"blo00012",5],[33,"blo00015",5],[34,"blo00009",5],[34,"blo00012",5],[34,"blo00015",5],[35,"blo00009",5],[35,"blo00012",5],[35,"blo00015",5],[36,"blo00003",50],[36,"ubl00401",50],[37,"blo00009",5],[37,"blo00012",5],[37,"blo00015",5],[38,"blo00009",5],[38,"blo00012",5],[38,"blo00015",5],[39,"blo00009",5],[39,"blo00012",5],[39,"blo00015",5],[40,"blo00009",5],[40,"blo00012",5],[40,"blo00015",5],[41,"blo00003",25],[41,"ubl00401",100],[42,"blo00009",5],[42,"blo00012",5],[42,"blo00015",5],[43,"blo00009",5],[43,"blo00012",5],[43,"blo00015",5],[44,"blo00009",5],[44,"blo00012",5],[44,"blo00015",5],[45,"blo00009",5],[45,"blo00012",5],[45,"blo00015",5],[46,"blo00003",50],[46,"ubl00401",50],[47,"blo00009",5],[47,"blo00012",5],[47,"blo00015",5],[48,"blo00009",5],[48,"blo00012",5],[48,"blo00015",5],[49,"blo00009",5],[49,"blo00012",5],[49,"blo00015",5],[50,"blo00009",5],[50,"blo00012",5],[50,"blo00015",5]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"久しぶりね。何？　私のこと忘れたなんて言うんじゃないわよね。“雷神の対魔忍”水城ゆきかぜ参上！　ふふふ、また……よろしくね","en":"It's been a while. What? You've forgotten about me? Don't say that. I'm Yukikaze, the Taimanin of the Thunder God! Hehe, nice to see you again."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"ふふっ……んふふ～ん、ふ～ん、くすっ、ん～？　べっつにぃ。なんでもないわよ、ふふ","en":"Hehe... hmm, what's so funny? Nothing, really. Just thinking about something."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"守ってくれるって？　ふ～ん、カッコいいじゃない。子供扱いなんてしてないわよ。私も守るよ、今度こそ","en":"You're going to protect me? That's so cool. I don't feel like you're treating me like a kid. I'll protect you too, this time for sure."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"出撃する時は私も連れていきなさいよ。くれぐれも、一人で行こうとしないこと、いい？","en":"When you go out on a mission, take me with you. And don't even think about going alone, got it?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"ふうまにお姉さんぶれる日がくるなんてね～。は？　妹分？　ちょっと、それどこ見て言ってるのよ","en":"You think I'd act like a big sister? Ha! What are you talking about? A little sister? Where did you get that idea?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"あ、今ドキってした？　したでしょ、ウソ、だって顔が赤いし、大人の私にはわかるの。ふうまがねぇ、私にねぇ、うふふ","en":"Oh, you're blushing? Don't lie, I can tell. Your face is red. As an adult, I can see these things. Hehe."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"“雷神の対魔忍”の本気、見る覚悟はできた？","en":"Are you ready to see the true power of the Taimanin of the Thunder God?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"昔の私とは違う……これが雷遁の極致、対魔忍水城ゆきかぜの力よ","en":"I'm not the same as I was in the past... This is the ultimate Raijin technique, the power of Taimanin Yukikaze."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"この程度で私を捕まえたつもり？　だとしたら、随分と舐められたものね","en":"You think you can catch me with this? If so, you're underestimating me."},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00401_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"まだよっ、まだ私は戦えるっ！　こんなところで倒れるわけにはいかないのっ！","en":"Not yet, I can still fight! I won't lose here!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00401_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":3,"text":{"ja":"んんっ！？　くぅ、あぁっ、身体が熱い……これ、まさか媚薬っ！？　こんなものに、負ける、かあっ！","en":"Hmm! Ugh, ah... My body is burning... This must be an aphrodisiac! I won't lose to something like this!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00401_1_hom_r18_3.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00401_1/uni00401_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[100,200],"scenes":[["chr_0277_1_r18"],["chr_0277_2_r18"]],"stills":[["chr_0277_1a_r18"],["chr_0277_2a_r18"]],"obtain":[{"kind":"exchange","title":null,"start":"2021-10-15","end":null},{"kind":"exchange","title":null,"start":"2022-08-16","end":"2023-02-27"},{"kind":"exchange","title":null,"start":"2023-08-16","end":"2024-02-27"},{"kind":"spark","title":null,"need":300,"start":"2024-03-01","end":"2024-03-31"},{"kind":"exchange","title":null,"start":"2024-09-01","end":"2025-03-15"},{"kind":"exchange","title":null,"start":"2025-08-31","end":"2025-11-30"},{"kind":"exchange","title":null,"start":null,"end":"2026-12-02"}],"standardPool":true,"art":{"graphicId":"uni_00401","graphicNum":4,"r18GraphicId":"uni_00401_r18","r18GraphicNum":2,"spineId":"Chr_0277"},"skin":{"item":"liv00401_1","name":{"ja":"大人ゆきかぜ（スキン）"},"resource":"liv00401_1"}}